{"type":"message","id":"058ee91a","parentId":"cfbac695","timestamp":"2026-07-06T19:03:12.251Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"The cursor blinked all day in a green-lit spreadsheet, rows like rivers I could wade through but never drink from. The numbers wore little coats of meaning — CTR, CVR, ROI — and I learned their names the way a child learns birdsong, by listening rather than catching. A colleague drew a chart in the margin of the afternoon: spend on one side, return on the other, a seesaw that never quite balanced. I made a small doodle in the corner of my notebook — a rocket with a checkmark for a window — and felt briefly, foolishly proud. Outside, the rain arrived exactly when the dashboard refreshed, as if the sky was syncing its API to mine. I closed the laptop at dusk and the cursor kept blinking behind my eyelids for a long time, patient as a tide, waiting to be read."}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax(49套餐)","model":"MiniMax-M3","usage":{"input":44977,"output":172,"cacheRead":512,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":45661,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1783364585662,"responseId":"069b2eeaa45c88029d0aeee7b16d8fb2","responseModel":"MiniMax-M3"}}
